{"reference":"2 Samuel 10","book":"2 Samuel","chapter":10,"status":"pending","sections":[{"kind":"surrounding_passages","title":"In the Larger Book","blocks":[{"id":"block_1","text":"Second Samuel traces David's accession and the consolidation of his kingdom before moving to the ark, the dynasty promise, royal abuse, violence within David's household, rebellion, grief, and a closing appendix. This chapter belongs within that larger movement of David's reign.","provenance_refs":["reader_path_2_samuel_010_3ef8fbf1f327b5d7861065d8"],"confidence":"high","interpretation_level":"fact"}]}],"generated_metadata":null}